            "text": "{\"items\":[{\"name\":\"Tesorería General de la Nación (Argentina)\",\"description\":\"El organismo Tesorería General de la Nación (Argentina) es el ente público gubernamental encargado de la política y gestión financiera del Estado. Administra la liquidez y emite deuda soberana en los mercados para financiar el presupuesto público y sostener el funcionamiento de la administración.\",\"sector\":\"Soberano\",\"isCorporate\":false,\"country\":\"Argentina\",\"foundedYear\":\"1992\",\"issuancesCount\":71,\"links\":{\"self\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/bff/issuers/01a0c65f-4aee-752d-a8f1-94c3ff10ee1f\",\"metrics\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/bff/issuers/01a0c65f-4aee-752d-a8f1-94c3ff10ee1f/metrics\",\"metricsHistory\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/bff/issuers/01a0c65f-4aee-752d-a8f1-94c3ff10ee1f/metrics/history\",\"issuances\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/bff/issuers/01a0c65f-4aee-752d-a8f1-94c3ff10ee1f/issuances\",\"upcomingPayments\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/bff/issuers/01a0c65f-4aee-752d-a8f1-94c3ff10ee1f/upcoming-payments\",\"paymentSchedule\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/bff/issuers/01a0c65f-4aee-752d-a8f1-94c3ff10ee1f/payment-schedule\",\"debtComposition\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/bff/issuers/01a0c65f-4aee-752d-a8f1-94c3ff10ee1f/debt-composition\",\"externalLocation\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/instrument-issuers/b11a569e-610e-4519-b775-c6cd35dc72fc\"}}],\"pagination\":{\"limit\":1,\"offset\":0,\"total\":1},\"links\":{\"self\":\"https://api.mercapabbaco.com/bff/issuers?externalLocation=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.mercapabbaco.com%2Finstrument-issuers%2Fb11a569e-610e-4519-b775-c6cd35dc72fc&limit=1&offset=0\"}}"
